---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /services/
title: "Air Conditioning Services Scotland | Install, Service, Repair | GMA"
description: "Air conditioning installation, reactive repairs, planned maintenance, TM44 inspections & F-Gas compliance across Edinburgh, Scotland & the North of England. Call 0131 564 0113."
crumb: Services
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">What we do</span>
    <h1>Our Services</h1>
    <p>With over 25 years in the industry, we offer a comprehensive range of air conditioning & ventilation services tailored to your needs.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container grid grid--3">
    {%- for s in services.items %}
    <article class="card" id="{{ s.title | slugify2 }}">
      <div class="card__icon">{% icon s.icon %}</div>
      <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
      {% if s.link %}<a class="card__link" href="{{ s.link }}">Find out more {% icon "arrow" %}</a>{% else %}<a class="card__link" href="/contact/?service={{ s.title | urlencode }}">Request a quote {% icon "arrow" %}</a>{% endif %}
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Need a quote?</span>
      <h2>Free site surveys & competitive pricing</h2>
      <p>Get in touch with our team to discuss your requirements. We offer free site surveys and competitive pricing across all our services – from a single repair to multi-site planned maintenance contracts.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Get in touch {% icon "arrow" %}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="split__img"><img src="/assets/img/gallery/commercial-daikin-units.webp" alt="Commercial Daikin outdoor units" loading="lazy" width="788" height="1400" style="object-position:center 30%"></div>
  </div>
</section>
